  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "- Version: 2.0.1\n          - Added:\n          - Comprehensive xUnit tests for Is.LessThan.cs:\n          - Generic LessThan<TLeft, TRight> cases: left < right (true), left == right (false), left > right (false).\n          - Generic LessThanOrEqual<TLeft, TRight> cases: left < right (true), left == right (true), left > right (false).\n          - String overloads for LessThan and LessThanOrEqual with StringComparison (Ordinal, OrdinalIgnoreCase).\n          - Callback verification: invoked exactly once with GuardOutcome.Success on true results, GuardOutcome.Failure on false results.\n          - Null argument behavior: throws ArgumentNullException for lValue/rValue; callback still invoked with GuardOutcome.Failure.\n\n          - Changed: None\n          - Fixed: None\n          - Breaking Changes: None\n          - Notes:\n          - Tests use xUnit’s Assert API (no external assertion libraries).\n          - String comparisons explicitly pass StringComparison for deterministic behavior.",
